  "description": "Sitelas is a website builder Claude operates for you.\n\nDescribe what you want, and Claude picks a hand-tuned design that fits your brief — business, restaurant, real estate, SaaS, photography — rewrites the copy, lays out the pages, and hands back a private preview. Nothing goes live until you say so, then publish to yourname.sitelas.com or your own domain with automatic SSL.\n\nAfter launch, Claude keeps running the site. In a single chat turn, it can:\n\n- Edit copy and design\n- Add pages\n- Read and reply to contact-form submissions\n- Check analytics\n- Schedule a publish\n\nPrefer to click? There's a full visual editor in the browser too.",
